    "b-step2-body-2": {
      "id": "b-step2-body-2",
      "flavour": "paragraph",
      "children": [],
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "After studying the latest step-1 result, the agent replaces the temporary stage in a structural batch. removeSection disposes stage and cascades through its placeholder; addSection establishes Runner loop in the same skeleton position. The agent judges that pushed render before a second call fills Runner loop with three process nodes and the terminal decision. Same role means the nodes copy one size, one centerline, and one repeated group gap from digest geometry; the 16px grid only quantizes those choices. The section gives the row a home and remains an addressable unit, while Config stays untouched. Each successful call pushes APPLIED, a fresh BOARD digest, DELTA, cumulative BOARD DIFF, LINTS, and REQUESTS; the fill call also pushes a fresh full-board render and the requested Runner loop close-up. No connection is touched, so ROUTES is absent. A crowding warning means the repeated gap is below the arrow-corridor floor, even when the row looks uniform."
        }
      ]
    },
    "b-step2-code-3": {
      "id": "b-step2-code-3",
      "flavour": "code",
      "children": [],
      "props": {
        "language": "json"
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "[\n  {\n    \"ops\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"removeSection\",\n        \"sectionId\": \"stage\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addSection\",\n        \"section\": {\n          \"id\": \"loop\",\n          \"text\": \"Runner loop\",\n          \"color\": \"gray\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 304, \"y\": 0, \"width\": 720, \"height\": 576 }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"ops\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addObject\",\n        \"object\": {\n          \"id\": \"cli\",\n          \"type\": \"process\",\n          \"text\": \"cli\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 352, \"y\": 288, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addObject\",\n        \"object\": {\n          \"id\": \"sched\",\n          \"type\": \"process\",\n          \"text\": \"sched\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 528, \"y\": 288, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addObject\",\n        \"object\": {\n          \"id\": \"workers\",\n          \"type\": \"process\",\n          \"text\": \"workers\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 704, \"y\": 288, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"addObject\",\n        \"object\": {\n          \"id\": \"match\",\n          \"type\": \"decision\",\n          \"text\": \"match\",\n          \"geometry\": { \"x\": 880, \"y\": 288, \"width\": 112, \"height\": 64 }\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"view\": \"loop\"\n  }\n]"
        }
